# This file is intentionally a no-op.
#
# Docker only consults the .dockerignore at the BUILD CONTEXT root. The web
# Dockerfile is built with the repo root as context
# (`docker build -f apps/web/Dockerfile .`), so the REAL exclusions live in the
# root .dockerignore — including the .env* secret exclusions. This stub exists
# only to document that fact; leaving protective-looking exclusions here would
# be misleading, since they would never apply.
#
# See /.dockerignore and docs/specs/deployment.md.
